{title: White Flag}
{artist: Chris Tomlin}
{key: C}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]The battle rages on
[C]As storms and tempests roar
[C]We cannot win this fight
Inside our rebel [G]hearts

{comment: Pre Chorus}
We're [F]laying down our [Am]weapons  [G]now

{comment: Chorus}
[Am]We raise our [F]white flag
[C]We [G]surrender all  [Am]to [F]You, [C]all  for [G]You
[Am]We raise our [F]white flag: the [C]war is [G]over
[Am]Love has [F]come, Your [C]love has [G]won

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]Here on this holy ground
[C]You made a way for peace
[C]Laying your body down
You took our rightful [G]place

{comment: Pre Chorus}
This [F]freedom song is [Am]marching [G]on

{comment: Bridge}

[C]We lift the cross, lift it high, lift it high (x4)
[C]We lift the [F]cross, Lift it [C]high, lift it high[G] (x4)
